WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:11.640
This sky is too brilliant, a new dawn has arrived.

00:17.980 --> 00:24.460
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

00:24.560 --> 00:31.560
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

00:32.390 --> 00:39.760
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

00:39.930 --> 00:43.070
If my wish comes true...

00:43.070 --> 00:49.820
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

00:49.820 --> 00:56.540
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

00:56.540 --> 01:06.050
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

01:06.360 --> 01:13.080
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

01:13.370 --> 01:23.760
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

01:47.550 --> 01:49.830
All hail Gerot!

01:50.200 --> 01:59.340
All hail Gerot! All hail Gerot! All hail Gerot!

01:59.620 --> 02:03.350
Listen, my precious nephews.

02:03.460 --> 02:09.110
We are going to bring an end to our war against the hateful believers of Lelihion over the past centuries.

02:09.390 --> 02:12.360
The time for our final war against them is coming.

02:13.180 --> 02:15.750
Fight! Keep fighting!

02:15.950 --> 02:20.360
We are to protect the Holy Land, in the name of Sablum's king!

02:21.160 --> 02:27.870
We shall stand united until we've conquered them — no, the entire world!

02:28.260 --> 02:30.370
Give praise to Aruke!

02:30.550 --> 02:33.050
Praise to Aruke!

02:33.050 --> 02:35.320
All hail to our king!

02:46.130 --> 02:47.390
What a brave attitude.

02:48.210 --> 02:50.370
Very good.

02:54.060 --> 03:02.550
However, our king ought to dispose of a favorite child of the previous king of Windland.

03:02.550 --> 03:05.220
As I remember...

03:06.250 --> 03:11.490
She is a survivor of the Blue Moon Tragedy sixteen years ago,

03:11.490 --> 03:17.330
as well as the daughter of the Sword Saint, Meister, and the Princess Knight, Princea, isn't she?

03:18.830 --> 03:19.920
Our king...

03:20.790 --> 03:24.430
A country is something like an eerie, venomous insect.

03:24.760 --> 03:29.620
It doesn't matter how much harm you cause it,

03:29.620 --> 03:32.330
it will never die as long as its head survives.

03:32.980 --> 03:36.010
Damn it! Haven't you found her yet?!

03:36.010 --> 03:39.570
How long does it take you to find one little brat?!

03:40.520 --> 03:44.440
Yes, sir. Currently, the search for the child is still in progress.

03:45.970 --> 03:48.400
No more excuses!

03:48.400 --> 03:52.130
I've been receiving the same report for the past sixteen years.

03:52.480 --> 03:57.090
Only the Rosenberg area, which belongs
to Regent Kizarov, remains.

03:57.580 --> 04:01.800
Speaking of Kizarov, he's King Meister's best friend.

04:02.860 --> 04:03.970
I see.

04:04.950 --> 04:13.850
Sablum's pathetic spies can neither find the heir to the throne nor sneak into his domain.

04:14.020 --> 04:15.550
Darkness Knight, cut it out!

04:15.550 --> 04:17.860
Don't be rude to King Gerot!

04:18.090 --> 04:19.550
Get him out of here!

04:19.550 --> 04:21.290
A mercenary should only do what they're paid to do!

04:21.290 --> 04:22.860
Put him to the sword!

04:23.080 --> 04:26.000
Shut up! I said shut up!

04:27.740 --> 04:30.340
You two have every reason to say so.

04:31.010 --> 04:34.870
Cellima! My favorite niece!

04:39.700 --> 04:42.380
Did you call for me, King Gerot?

04:42.690 --> 04:44.010
Listen...

04:44.010 --> 04:51.010
You assassins exist for the purpose of bringing peace to Sablum behind the scenes...

04:51.010 --> 04:54.390
by disturbing the peace of our rival country, Windland.

04:54.560 --> 04:55.850
Is that clear?

04:55.850 --> 05:01.400
Yes! That's why my father gave me
the name that means peace.

05:01.550 --> 05:09.410
Good! Now go to Rosenberg to kill the royal successor and root out the lineage!

05:09.580 --> 05:10.050
Yes, sir!

05:17.630 --> 05:20.920
The Knights' Acadamy

05:30.690 --> 05:35.930
Presently, our beloved kingdom of the wind, Windland, is being targeted...

05:36.690 --> 05:42.100
by vicious Sablum, which has occupied Resrexion and committed atrocities.

05:42.100 --> 05:46.950
Those who will save our Windland are... YOU!

05:48.600 --> 05:51.950
Welcome to the Rosenberg Knights' Academy!

05:52.260 --> 06:00.380
We provide you practical know-how of the ways knights and sorcerers fight in combat...

06:00.380 --> 06:03.240
to help you become strong knights very quickly.

06:03.240 --> 06:06.420
We will also have an explanation on how to reserve magic.

06:06.420 --> 06:13.140
This is why we welcome everyone, even if you are complete novices who have never even used a sword!

06:17.960 --> 06:26.160
Also, since all instructors are professional knights appointed from the country's troops,

06:26.160 --> 06:29.260
they can give you practical lessons in combat training.

06:30.650 --> 06:32.740
Of course, the academy has more special features!

06:33.180 --> 06:39.950
Teachers in the Rosenberg Knights' Academy are all professional sorcerers!

06:44.410 --> 06:45.590
Furthermore...

06:45.590 --> 06:53.640
Our academy has private dormitories, allowing you to train twelve hours a day, from "Good Morning" to "Good Night."

06:55.850 --> 06:57.510
Cut!

06:57.800 --> 06:59.270
What's that?!

06:59.580 --> 07:02.770
No, no, no, no!

07:03.080 --> 07:05.530
What are you doing, Priecia?!

07:07.090 --> 07:08.530
Let me guide you!

07:08.770 --> 07:12.270
Expose your cleavage a bit more to make you more alluring.

07:12.270 --> 07:13.530
Then put your arms like this.

07:13.530 --> 07:15.360
Oh yeah, yeah! Nice, isn't it?

07:15.630 --> 07:18.330
And squeeze your breasts between your arms.

07:18.330 --> 07:22.040
Nice... Nice, Priecia.

07:22.080 --> 07:29.340
Your beautiful hands and feet, clear and white skin, cute and dynamite body...

07:30.740 --> 07:32.340
Perfect!!

07:32.930 --> 07:39.030
Where in Windland — no, the entire world, could one find such a perfect girl like you?

07:39.050 --> 07:40.350
No, they never could!

07:52.680 --> 07:54.870
Please cut it out already!

07:55.050 --> 07:56.570
Geez...

07:56.570 --> 08:02.700
Why do I have to perform such a ridiculous play, indecently dressed like this?

08:03.490 --> 08:05.590
Because we need...

08:05.590 --> 08:08.130
young, strong, and brave people.

08:09.430 --> 08:14.570
Ever since the Sablum Empire began using the mysterious weapon called Angels,

08:15.770 --> 08:20.630
our Saint Crusaders have been pushed back, even though we used to have an edge over them.

08:20.630 --> 08:24.920
And now they've captured half the domain of Windland.

08:25.580 --> 08:28.420
The finance of our forces has deteriorated...

08:28.420 --> 08:32.360
and our personnel attrition rate has sky rocketed.

08:32.920 --> 08:37.440
People and money are things we desperately need.

08:37.440 --> 08:42.000
Making a holo-prism film to persuade young people to join...

08:43.400 --> 08:51.420
That's an important job not only of the academy, but yourself, whom is destined to protect our country's future, okay?

08:51.650 --> 08:58.930
Okay, but why do I have to be dressed like this?

08:59.100 --> 09:05.880
As I said, we need young, strong, and brave people.

09:05.880 --> 09:06.940
Do you follow me?

09:07.260 --> 09:09.620
Unbounded virility!

09:09.620 --> 09:13.440
We're trying to motivate young, energetic people for the future of Windland.

09:13.680 --> 09:16.000
You can say this is a strategy.

09:16.000 --> 09:17.930
S-Strategy?

09:18.640 --> 09:23.200
Yeah, is there a man who wouldn't be
motivated after watching this?

09:24.720 --> 09:25.970
No, there won't!

09:33.960 --> 09:36.490
It's about time for the entrance ceremony,

09:36.490 --> 09:39.470
so I'll have to excuse myself now, Marquis.

09:43.730 --> 09:45.480
<i>Finally...</i>

09:47.350 --> 09:49.520
<i>Finally, the day has come.</i>

09:51.310 --> 09:56.860
<i>Show your presence in the kingdom of Windland...</i>

09:57.820 --> 10:05.950
<i>to our troops exhausted with the war, to our people in despair, and to our enemies.</i>

10:05.950 --> 10:11.360
<i>Your own life and Windland's destiny...</i>

10:11.360 --> 10:13.500
<i>I will entrust both to you, Priecia.</i>

10:15.050 --> 10:15.520
Alright.

10:35.330 --> 10:40.870
King Gerot, I've reached the center of our enemies at last. Our enemies.

10:42.800 --> 10:48.740
Starting today, I'm giving up the name given to me by my father, Cellima,

10:48.740 --> 10:51.540
and posing as a student in Windland named B...

10:51.800 --> 10:54.050
Bri... Briri...

10:54.500 --> 10:57.470
Huh? Ah, geez!

10:59.410 --> 11:06.060
Under the name of B-Bridget, I'm gonna sneak into the Rosenberg Knights' Academy!

11:08.470 --> 11:10.610
I'll give it my all!

11:23.000 --> 11:24.080
What?!

11:24.080 --> 11:24.120
She has come to Windland

11:24.080 --> 11:24.120
The Princess of Hope!!

11:25.620 --> 11:25.660
Is it!?

11:28.160 --> 11:31.140
Who's this Priecia?

11:31.140 --> 11:33.300
Eh?! You don't know her?

11:33.300 --> 11:35.540
You're so behind!

11:35.540 --> 11:42.690
The rumor is that Priecia may be the princess of Windland.

11:42.690 --> 11:46.610
By princess, you mean the missing princess?

11:46.610 --> 11:51.520
Priecia sounds just like the queen's name, Princea.

11:51.520 --> 11:53.180
It sure does!

11:53.470 --> 12:00.280
Whether she is of royalty or not, she is said to be a genius who is excellent in both academics and sports.

12:00.370 --> 12:04.710
<i>Oh, Aruke! What a lucky assassin I am!</i>

12:05.220 --> 12:12.280
<i>I'm going to find the target the Sablum Empire couldn't, even with concerted efforts! Find the target!</i>

12:12.530 --> 12:19.940
To annihilate the Sablum Empire and bring glorious victory to Windland,

12:19.940 --> 12:25.520
rigorous training is awaiting you new students, who came here to become brave knights for our kingdom.

12:25.520 --> 12:29.520
Hey Acty, look there! There's a lot of Mokujin!

12:25.520 --> 12:29.520
Note: Mokujin means wooden puppet.

12:29.640 --> 12:31.180
So what, Jung?

12:31.180 --> 12:34.090
What's there to get excited about magical scarecrows?

12:34.150 --> 12:43.510
However, I believe the blood and sweat you shed will ultimately lead to the power to defeat our enemy, the Sablum Empire!

12:34.180 --> 12:36.050
That's because,

12:36.050 --> 12:41.160
the Mokujin prototype went out of control on the farms and was recalled.

12:43.510 --> 12:48.610
So shed your pure, righteous, and beautiful blood for the sake of our future victory!

12:48.610 --> 12:50.560
Now, swear together with me!

12:51.550 --> 12:57.080
Hey, hey... That hot-blooded instructor
is even gonna make us bleed?

12:57.420 --> 13:00.180
Karin, that was a good speech.

13:00.380 --> 13:01.590
Ms. Litte.

13:02.320 --> 13:07.090
By the way, I'm impressed to see this many Mokujin in a row.

13:07.410 --> 13:13.100
Indeed. We ordered them in a hurry from the royal capital for that Priecia everyone is talking about.

13:13.600 --> 13:19.560
The Marquis commented that her skill with a sword is remarkably close to His Majesty, King Meister's.

13:19.560 --> 13:21.610
I'm planning to let her show us her technique with these.

13:21.940 --> 13:24.080
That's a great idea.

13:24.080 --> 13:29.120
No doubt it will raise the morale of the new students.

13:29.770 --> 13:33.610
I would love to meet Lady Priecia soon.

13:33.810 --> 13:36.000
Rumor has it that,

13:36.340 --> 13:40.080
she could use Prism magic since she was just starting to speak.

13:40.080 --> 13:41.260
No way!

13:41.260 --> 13:42.990
Are you sure? Are you serious?

13:43.600 --> 13:47.460
I can only manage a few spells of water and wind, though.

13:47.460 --> 13:49.800
The world must've been made to be unfair!

13:49.800 --> 13:55.590
<i>Her sword technique is no less skillful than their previous king's, and she's also a sophisticated sorcerer.</i>

13:55.590 --> 13:58.350
<i>I wonder if she's like this...</i>

13:59.410 --> 14:02.900
<i>For example, muscles like a gorilla,</i>

14:03.850 --> 14:05.650
<i>and teeth like a wolf...</i>

14:10.170 --> 14:16.370
<i>King G-Gerot... P-P-Priecia sounds like a dreadful girl according to their rumors.</i>

14:16.370 --> 14:19.540
<i>I doubt I could even beat such a monster-like person...</i>

14:19.540 --> 14:22.190
<i>Cellima is feeling terribly nervous right now. Terribly nervous.</i>

14:24.570 --> 14:27.220
Glow Lash!

14:30.550 --> 14:32.700
What <i>are</i> these?!

14:32.700 --> 14:35.310
It's making me so embarrassed!

14:35.310 --> 14:37.890
I have no idea what the Marquis is thinking.

14:37.890 --> 14:40.230
I have no clue what he wants me to do.

14:43.730 --> 14:46.570
It must be a waste to think of it.

14:47.030 --> 14:50.740
Oh... So a gifted princess is entering our school.

14:51.410 --> 14:52.740
I wonder what kind of girl she is.

14:53.190 --> 14:54.240
Right?

14:55.410 --> 14:58.650
Hello. You're late, too?

14:58.650 --> 14:59.700
Like me, huh?

14:59.880 --> 15:02.790
I didn't... come here lat—

15:02.820 --> 15:03.810
Let's go quickly.

15:03.810 --> 15:05.470
Hopefully, we'll get a chance to meet the princess.

15:07.580 --> 15:09.050
Hey, who are you?

15:09.060 --> 15:10.780
Who allowed you to do this?!

15:11.120 --> 15:12.900
Me? I'm Hyaweh!

15:13.070 --> 15:13.770
Nice to meet you!

15:15.100 --> 15:17.920
Who gave you the right to...

15:18.300 --> 15:21.200
Listen to me!

15:22.200 --> 15:25.620
Ah! It's the princess!

15:34.210 --> 15:35.790
P-P-Princess?!

15:36.270 --> 15:37.540
Your hair is in braids...

15:38.210 --> 15:40.670
Yeah, yeah! Hey girl, what's your name?

15:43.820 --> 15:48.300
Well, I... Uh... I'm...

15:48.300 --> 15:51.230
I'm Bri... Pri...

15:52.890 --> 15:56.310
Priecia! As I thought, Priecia, aren't you!

15:56.810 --> 16:00.660
You are... You're the princess!

16:01.810 --> 16:07.280
Eh, princess!? No, I'm Bri... Bridge...

16:09.720 --> 16:13.630
Marvelous! May I ask you if you're the princess...

16:13.840 --> 16:16.100
Oh, how beautiful!

16:16.920 --> 16:19.210
You wear glasses to conceal your identity?

16:19.530 --> 16:22.310
Is it true that you've even mastered dark magic?

16:22.370 --> 16:23.870
Can you become my girlfriend?

16:29.080 --> 16:30.620
Be quiet!

16:45.200 --> 16:47.150
Oh, Aruke...

16:47.150 --> 16:53.700
I don't know what happened, but that cool woman helped me out. Helped me out.

16:54.670 --> 16:57.700
We've been waiting for you, Lady Priecia.

17:00.150 --> 17:00.850
Now, now...

17:00.850 --> 17:02.710
Step up to the podium.

17:04.120 --> 17:04.910
Huh?

17:09.580 --> 17:15.720
<i>Oh, Aruke. What am I doing this for? Doing this for?</i>

17:17.340 --> 17:19.220
So she's the princess.

17:19.610 --> 17:21.080
Seems so.

17:21.080 --> 17:22.830
Huh? What's wrong?

17:22.830 --> 17:24.660
You seem to be angry.

17:24.660 --> 17:26.550
I'm not angry.

17:26.550 --> 17:29.470
What makes you think I'm angry?

17:29.470 --> 17:31.230
Oh, sorry.

17:32.260 --> 17:35.740
<i>The girl pretending to be me isn't the only problem.</i>

17:36.020 --> 17:40.740
<i>I wonder why the Marquis is letting her.</i>

17:43.020 --> 17:44.940
So, Lady Priecia,

17:44.940 --> 17:50.940
would you show us an example of your skill with the sword for all of our students?

17:50.940 --> 17:52.510
I-I'm not...

17:52.860 --> 17:54.680
Mokujin, activate!

18:11.050 --> 18:13.790
Hey, don't you think something is strange about her?

18:13.790 --> 18:17.410
Oh, yeah. She looks nothing like a genius.

18:17.410 --> 18:21.530
Oh no... Isn't she in danger?

18:28.490 --> 18:30.540
Ryuugazan!

18:28.490 --> 18:30.540
Dragon Fang Slash

18:34.160 --> 18:36.050
Are you alright, Lady Priecia?

18:36.850 --> 18:37.940
I'm not!

18:37.940 --> 18:42.560
I'm not Priecia, but Bridget! Bridget!

18:43.540 --> 18:44.140
W-What?!

18:47.950 --> 18:50.650
I never thought I could have mistook you for her.

18:51.810 --> 18:53.070
Look out!

18:57.430 --> 18:59.070
I appreciate that.

18:59.070 --> 19:03.290
But why didn't you tell me earlier?

19:03.290 --> 19:04.460
We'll talk later.

19:04.460 --> 19:05.740
We're gonna bring them down first!

19:05.830 --> 19:06.810
Okay, yeah!

19:19.280 --> 19:20.590
That sword handling...

19:28.250 --> 19:29.440
It's terrible!

19:34.490 --> 19:36.800
Glow Lash!

19:43.480 --> 19:44.420
She...

19:44.680 --> 19:46.450
Don't tell me... the real...

19:47.140 --> 19:48.380
Princess!

19:49.900 --> 19:51.830
<i>No doubt about it.</i>

19:51.830 --> 19:56.000
<i>She must be the princess of Windland!</i>

19:56.330 --> 20:03.510
<i>Oh, Aruke! Things are getting more and more complicated.</i>

20:03.990 --> 20:08.950
<i>At the moment, the person I'm trying
to kill saved me. Saved me.</i>

20:11.660 --> 20:14.620
Uh, are you Pri—

20:15.950 --> 20:19.030
Tell me why you were pretending to be me?

20:19.030 --> 20:22.330
Depending on your answer, I may cut off your head.

20:22.440 --> 20:25.770
A-A-Actually, I didn't know anything, so...

20:26.370 --> 20:29.230
I'm sorry... I apologize... Forgive me. Forgive me!

20:30.630 --> 20:32.040
Stop it.

20:32.040 --> 20:34.330
She properly apologized, right?

20:36.270 --> 20:39.090
When did he get here?!

20:39.710 --> 20:42.470
She must have a good reason.

20:42.470 --> 20:44.520
Let's listen to her first.

20:47.080 --> 20:49.380
I can't move my... Why?

20:49.920 --> 20:50.870
Okay?

20:51.970 --> 20:52.830
That boy...

20:54.160 --> 20:55.400
He can do it.

20:56.070 --> 20:57.590
No, I won't forgive her.

20:57.590 --> 21:02.040
She brought disgrace on my name and
dignity. For that, I'll slash her.

21:02.040 --> 21:05.530
And if you still try to stop me, I'll slash you as well!

21:12.800 --> 21:17.210
It's useless. You can never cut me down.

21:17.760 --> 21:20.860
Because the rapier is a sword to thrust at your enemy.

21:20.860 --> 21:24.350
So if your opponent gets this close,
there's no way you could win.

21:24.350 --> 21:25.720
My grandpa said so.

21:28.570 --> 21:30.970
Your angry face is beautiful, too.

21:31.310 --> 21:34.790
Why... Why are you...

21:34.790 --> 21:38.970
Why are you making fun of me?!

21:40.220 --> 21:42.640
Glow Lash!

21:56.000 --> 22:02.230
When the star has fallen and the day becomes night,

22:02.610 --> 22:09.050
will the noise that I heard until yesterday disappear, too?

22:09.050 --> 22:15.840
In this brief moment of gentle wind, the sunlight shining through the trees

22:15.840 --> 22:22.530
gives me warmth in this dull scenery,

22:22.770 --> 22:29.620
so that I will still go on and reach that feeling!

22:30.120 --> 22:37.620
Even if I'm crying, even if I'm painfully wandering.

22:37.620 --> 22:43.550
I believe in your only radiance over there.

22:43.550 --> 22:50.820
Like the mists that shrouded the raining Earth,

22:51.130 --> 22:57.600
if all the meeting can be repeated on this planet,

22:57.850 --> 23:05.050
within this strange power, it will change into a miracle.

23:14.970 --> 23:17.770
Next Episode

23:15.400 --> 23:17.070
Oh, Aruke.

23:17.070 --> 23:19.660
Though I had a hard time on my first day...

23:19.660 --> 23:25.730
Ah, in the next episode, I'm gonna have a hard time with a washtub and a guillotine.

23:25.730 --> 23:29.480
School is a scary place. Scary.

23:29.480 --> 23:32.010
Next episode, The Knight's Goal.

23:32.010 --> 23:34.820
Shine, the prism of heart!

23:34.560 --> 23:39.090
The Knight's Goal

23:34.820 --> 23:39.090
By the way, I wish for something that could add some sparkle to my life. Some sparkle...
